    A[用户输入]:::b --> B[Persona Runtime<br/>spoken_reply + effect_calls]:::a
    B --> C[TTS WAV + Plain + motion]:::a
    C --> D[后端 PendingOutputSegment<br/>turn_id + message_id]:::b
