    I --> J[HTMLAudioElement<br/>真实 audio clock]:::d
    J --> K[约 90ms 后启动 ModelEngine]:::e
    J --> L[Lip sync<br/>同一 AudioElement]:::e
    K --> M[Live2D WebSDK<br/>逐帧写参]:::e
    L --> N[Timeline 终态聚合]:::c
    M --> N
    J --> N
    N --> O[playback_finished → turn_finished]:::b
